Third-party components
================================================================================

The compiled frontend bundles portions of @decky/api 1.1.3:

  Author: SteamDeckHomebrew Team
  License: GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1 (LGPL-2.1)
  Source: https://www.npmjs.com/package/@decky/api/v/1.1.3

Its license text is distributed as
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/decky-api-LGPL-2.1.txt and its complete package source as
THIRD_PARTY_SOURCES/decky-api-1.1.3/. The release also includes the plugin's
frontend source, source map and reproducible build inputs; see SOURCE.md. The
same source is available at https://github.com/Rayekkk/LeGo2BrightnessFix.

The plugin shells out to `xprop` (xorg-xprop) to read and write the gamescope
atoms, and otherwise reads sysfs. Both are already part of SteamOS; neither is
redistributed here.

`lego_updater.py` shares its implementation with the author's other DeckyLoader
plugins, so fixes to the trust store or host allowlist can be kept in sync. It
is not third-party code.
